  "fullDescription": "Retro Pizza font is a bold, rounded display typeface with a distinctly retro and playful character. Featuring thick, soft-edged letterforms and generous counters, it evokes a 1970s diner or vintage food packaging aesthetic. The exaggerated weight and inflated letter shapes create a sense of warmth and friendliness, ideal for branding, signage, and nostalgic-themed designs. Its geometric proportions are consistent, enhancing legibility despite its decorative intent. The font is available in OTF, TTF, SVG, and EPS formats, supporting versatile design applications across print and digital media.",
